cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: ORMConvertor
abstract: >-
  A tool for translating entities, mappings, and queries between .NET ORM frameworks
  (Dapper, NHibernate, Entity Framework Core) through a framework-agnostic intermediate
  representation, together with an ILP-based advisor that recommends a framework for a
  query workload from real benchmark measurements. This repository continues and extends
  the ORMorpher prototype created by Milan Abrahám; the publications listed under
  references describe the design of that prototype.
